    <string name="settings_ai_explain">When you add a game, the AI researches it on the web by itself: it fills in missing facts (players, playing time, age, designers, description) and finds a picture of the box front, checks it and crops it. Claude, Gemini and ChatGPT search the web themselves (Claude: web search must be enabled in the Anthropic Console). Self-hosted models have no web access – they check the pictures Boardshelf finds instead.</string>
