    <string name="settings_demo_load">Load demo games</string>
    <string name="settings_gameupc_explain">Barcodes are looked up in GameUPC (board game barcodes incl. European editions, crowd-sourced), UPCitemdb, Open Products Facts and Wikidata. GameUPC has no sign-up: Boardshelf uses the public access that GameUPC\'s own demos use. When you pick a game after scanning, the assignment is sent back to GameUPC to improve the database. A personal key is only available by e-mail from the operator – leave the field empty otherwise.</string>
